# Demo of BVR-CLI Usage
Output docs/media/demo-usage.gif
Output docs/media/demo-usage.webm

Require bvr

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Padding 30
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Type "bvr"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "Can you implement a fast sorting algorithm in Go?"
Sleep 1s
Enter

Sleep 5s

Type "/exit"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
